## Original Content
Dolly Parton, légende de la country et icône populaire américaine, est décédée mardi à 80 ans. En mai, la chanteuse, qui aura sorti des dizaines d'albums et écoulé plus de 100 millions de disques tout au long de sa carrière, avait annoncé le report de plusieurs concerts, évoquant des problèmes de santé.

## Summary
Dolly Parton, an American country music legend and pop icon, has died at the age of 80. Her death follows health issues that led to the postponement of concerts earlier in the year. She leaves behind a legacy of numerous albums and over 100 million records sold.

## Key Points
- Dolly Parton passed away at 80 years old.
- She was a renowned figure in country and popular music.
- Health problems caused the postponement of several concerts.
- Her career spanned decades with extensive album releases and record sales.


